# SRG SRG-APP-000108-WSR-000166: The web server must use a logging mechanism that is configur
# STIG ID: V-206366 (MEDIUM)
# Check: Web server logging configuration

META
    esp_id `web-srg-srg-app-000108-wsr-000166-log-failure-alerting-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `web-server`
    criticality `high`

    title `SRG SRG-APP-000108-WSR-000166: The web server must use a logging mechanism that is configured to alert the ISSO`
    description `The web server must use a logging mechanism that is configured to alert the ISSO and SA in the event of a processing failure.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `web-server,srg,disa-stig,logging,internal`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:SRG-APP-000108-WSR-000166,NIST-800-53:AU-5`
    control_objective `AU-5`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `WebServer:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Web Server SRG guidance for SRG-APP-000108-WSR-000166.`

    component_id `comp-web-server`

    impl_AU_5 `This control is validated by probing the web server configuration or network endpoint against the DISA Web Server SRG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR config_path string `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`

    OBJECT web_config
        path VAR config_path
    OBJECT_END

    STATE log_check
        content string contains `alert`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF log_check
            OBJECT_REF web_config
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
